	(text "Rev A changes vs. carrier-netlist.net draft (review 2026-10-06)\n- IO15 sense: TPS3808G01 (U2, C3) replaces R1/R2 100k/47k; R2 now 11k3.\n- R8 4k7 bleeder on VIN_FUSED.\n- JP1 bridged by default (D1 bypassed); D1 only matters in fallback.\n- J5 is Molex PicoBlade 53261-0271 (module J1 is \"PH1.25\" = MX1.25).\nFirmware: IO7 high first in app_main; IO15 falling = power lost;\nin the halt loop, IO15 high again -> esp_restart().\nKeep the module microSD slot empty or 1-bit: IO15 is its D2 line."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "17454fea-ee41-4e5b-a655-b305dea42840")
	)
	(text "1  Car 5 V input, protection, D1 isolation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1bad7f3a-7735-41df-b382-afb2db1f0220")
	)
	(text "6  Mounting (M2.5, 8 mm standoffs)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2bf8c4d0-2deb-4fdb-91f9-460c531a4e25")
	)
	(text "2  Power-loss sense -> IO15 (PWR_SENSE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3844b60b-ac37-4b48-8085-de6ec0df7483")
	)
	(text "R8 bleeds VIN_FUSED to 0 V once the car\nport dies (~1 mA at 5 V): clean sense edge.\nJP1 bridged by default: D1 drop + PTC +\ncable would leave < 4.5 V (ETA6098 min in)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "390aff09-5ddb-484e-b250-c16bd4661c03")
	)
	(text "2 x 5 F / 2.7 V in series = 2.5 F, 5.4 V. Charged to 4.2 V by\nthe module ETA6098 through J5. Hold-up ~5-7 s, backlight off.\nSupercaps only: no LiPo on the module (car interior temps)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5fa24e3c-c8b4-4c0d-b204-eeb3da191be5")
	)
	(text "H1 = top-left hole, inside the antenna keep-out"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 227.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "984ff7dc-f2a5-44d7-8b6a-29a01ff242f0")
	)
	(text "4  Module link: J3 -> Waveshare J8 (SH 1.0, 12 p)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a32e5551-d47c-409c-976d-9e474f62e7a8")
	)
	(text "5  PN532 reader and debug UART"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b00ada4c-ebda-4eb4-8c87-c0839cea44ad")
	)
	(text "Supervisor runs from the module 3V3 (held up by the\nsupercaps), so ~RESET stays actively low after the car\nport is gone. Open drain; the module R30 10k pull-up\non IO15 is the pull-up.\nTrip: 0.405 V x (1 + 100k/11k3) = 3.99 V falling.\n~RESET released 20 ms after VIN_FUSED > 4.0 V (CT open).\nReplaces the rev A 100k/47k divider, which read HIGH\nwith the car on or off because of R30."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b5ef0011-a478-46fc-a365-5a475185e4f9")
	)
	(text "PN532 DIP: 1=ON 2=OFF (I2C), addr 0x24.\nShares the bus with RTC 0x51, IMU 0x6B;\nmodule has the I2C pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c5884d0f-bdc7-4f64-87ef-f238c5f9367a")
	)
	(text "3  Supercap hold-up bank (on module J1 BAT)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce67ccf7-7ba7-43d4-958d-1df0962e955c")
	)
	(text "Same-side (type A) SH cable, pin 1 to pin 1.\nAll module current + up to 2 A of charge current\npass J8 pin 2 (one SH contact, ~1 A rated):\nset the module ETA6098 RISET (R7) to >= 200k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d6c86536-af27-4cca-8e79-b06c13afcb04")
	)
	(text "J4.1 = module TXD (IO43) -> dongle RX\nJ4.2 = module RXD (IO44) <- dongle TX"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d70f4366-86fa-4ddf-9175-96a8ff8eaf0a")
	)
	(text "module J8\n 1  GND\n 2  USB_5V (in)\n 3  D- / IO19   n/c\n 4  D+ / IO20   n/c\n 5  GND\n 6  3V3 (out)\n 7  SCL / IO10\n 8  SDA / IO11\n 9  TXD / IO43\n10  RXD / IO44\n11  GPIO18 (R35 10k pull-up)\n12  GPIO15 (R30 10k pull-up)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e4436d63-513d-4bdd-b360-e88f20504e89")
	)
	(text "Fallback (DNP): open JP1 and JP2, unplug J5, fit R3 + D2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ec92144b-9158-410b-9f52-5719a7a86f6e")
	)
